OL,3,GNEWSAScience centre revamp will 'rocket
OL,4,Aboost' economy
OL,5,
OL,6,FPlans to revamp a research institute
OL,7,Finto a #500m global science hub has
OL,8,Freceived a major funding boost.
OL,10,FAn extra #107m was recently announced
OL,11,Fby the government towards the scheme at
OL,12,Fthe John Innes Centre (JIC) and The
OL,13,FSainsbury Laboratory (TSL), at Norwich
OL,14,FResearch Park.
OL,16,FIt is already a world-leading centre
OL,17,Ffor plant and microbial science, but
OL,18,Fthe project aims to transform parts of
OL,19,Fthe site to streamline operations and
OL,20,Fcreate state-of-the-art facilities.
OL,23,APub: 23-NovQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageB E Eng NewsC  Reg TVF Weather
